<div style="background:#17633d;padding:20px 0;text-align:center;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;">
  Thanks! Your Reservation is confirmed at {{hotelName}}
</div>
<div style="background:#fff;padding:32px 32px 24px 32px;">
  <p>Your booking with <b>{{hotelName}}</b> is unconfirmed and not guaranteed.<br>
  Please make payment of <b>₦{{bookingAmount}}</b> to immediately confirm your booking and room reservation. Unconfirmed booking may be cancelled at any time by the hotel.<br>
  If you wish to make payment arrangement, please reach the hotel.<br>
  Your booking details are below:</p>
  <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:24px 0;">
    <tr>
      <th style="text-align:left;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;">Room Reservation</th>
      <td style="padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;">{{numberOfRooms}} {{roomCategory}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th style="text-align:left;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;">Check-in</th>
      <td style="padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;">{{checkIn}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th style="text-align:left;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;">Check-out</th>
      <td style="padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;">{{checkOut}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th style="text-align:left;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;">Booking number</th>
      <td style="padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;">{{bookingReference}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th style="text-align:left;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;">Booked By</th>
      <td style="padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;">{{bookedBy}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th style="text-align:left;padding:8px;">Total Rooms Booked</th>
      <td style="padding:8px;">{{totalRooms}}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <p>The hotel reserves the right to change your selected room to a room in same or higher category for your comfort in the rare case of your selected room being unavailable.<br>
  <b>9jahotel</b>
  </p>
</div>